  "description": "Build-time object mapping for .NET. Declare partial mapping methods in a [GeneratedMapper] class and ConventionMapper writes plain C# mapping code into your project at compile time: no reflection, Native AOT and trimming safe, as fast as hand-written code and debuggable. Unmapped members are build errors.",
